It's a bad idea to attack a blinded floating eye.  I'd recommend never
doing it.  There is a small chance that your luck will be reduced by one,
and if you make a practice of doing this with all your tourists, the small
chance becomes a high probability.  There are other totally safe ways of
killing floating eyes.  Try throwing things at them, wearing something
reflective, or blinding yourself.  In a game as complex as nethack, I'm
sure there are other ways that don't immediately come to my mind.

